# ── Credentials ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit real credentials. salesforce.env is a safe template (placeholder
# values only) and IS tracked. Any filled-in copies must be listed here.
# Note: this project has no actual secrets — `sf` stores OAuth tokens itself in
# ~/.sfdx/ — but we still git-ignore local copies to match the pm-jira convention.
*.env.local
*.env.secret
.env
.env.*
!config/salesforce.env

# ── Project data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Report/query output may contain internal Salesforce data — keep off public repo
data/

# ── Generated reports ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
reports/

# ── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
__pycache__/
*.pyc
